t=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:TOOL_GEN_Broom_B\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7e695757-a137-4bbc-9a1d-8dcf1db63fee</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7e695757-a137-4bbc-9a1d-8dcf1db63fee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7e695757-a137-4bbc-9a1d-8dcf1db63fee\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Given as a consolation prize by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Akabi\" title=\"Akabi\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/25px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/38px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/50px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Akabi\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/25px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Akabi\" title=\"Akabi\">Akabi</a> after failing to win the jackpot at the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days#Layout\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Wheel of Fortune</a>\n</p>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Cannot be equipped.</li>\n<li>Does <i>not</i> in fact grant flying.</li>\n<li>This item may be a reference to Critical Role Campaign 1 in which Vex gets a flying broom and, while practicing with it trying to shoot chickens, manages instead to shoot Scanlan.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203054\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.045 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1465/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 22589/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4794/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931353/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.772      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   37.772      1 -total\n 50.06%   18.908      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.15%   16.676     14 Template:Trim\n 23.52%    8.884      2 Template:Uid\n 16.94%    6.400      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.99%    5.283      2 Template:Template_style\n 13.96%    5.272      2 Template:Icon_link\n 11.11%    4.196      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.93%    4.129      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:19380-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714203054 and revision id 297568. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}